019t light."},{"c":"msg","face":"keeper","name":"Bell-Keeper","text":"If it rings, they all go. All of them. She goes. My Hana goes. I cannot\u2026 I will not send her."},{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"Oh no. He\u2019s been holding the whole shore together out of grief."},{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"So we can\u2019t just smash our way through, can we."},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"No. We can\u2019t. Not like that."},{"c":"tutorial","id":"boss","text":"Boss tip: hit its weakness to break the Veil \u2014 then Parley or Send. The \u26a0 telegraph lands next round: Guard or break it with a Stun/Unveil.","ms":12000},{"c":"battle","troop":"boss_bell_keeper","boss":true,"noEscape":true,"win":[{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"The bronze armor falls away piece by piece, like autumn leaves. A tired priest remains, kneeling."},{"c":"msg","face":"keeper","name":"Priest Ren","text":"I could not\u2026 let her go. I did not want to be alone in the quiet."},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"You aren\u2019t alone. You never were. Hana waited, too. Let us ring it together."},{"c":"me","name":"fanfare"},{"c":"shake","power":2,"ms":800},{"c":"set","sw":"boss_done","v":true},{"c":"quest","id":"main","stage":6,"done":true,"quiet":false}],"lose":[{"c":"abort"}]},{"c":"flash","color":16777215,"ms":800},{"c":"se","name":"bell"},{"c":"wait","ms":900},{"c":"se","name":"bell"},{"c":"narrate","lines":["The Bell rang once, and the valley breathed out.","Across Ashiro, every lantern caught fire at once, and every spirit that had waited too long was finally able to go home.","Priest Ren lit the last lantern himself, for the daughter who had never really left."]},{"c":"narrate","lines":["Mio, Kaze and Daigo had only reached the first shore.","But the Bell was ringing again, and that was enough to begin."]},{"c":"end"}],[]],"cancel":-1}]}]},{"id":5,"x":6,"y":10,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":null,"g":{"sheet":"lantern2","dir":"down"},"trigger":"action","list":[],"enemy":{"troop":"tr_candle_spirit_candle_spirit_bell_mouse","aggro":3,"chase":true,"range":1,"spd":260}}]},{"id":6,"x":13,"y":9,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":null,"g":{"sheet":"kettle","dir":"down"},"trigger":"action","list":[],"enemy":{"troop":"tr_gloam_bat_ofuda_moth","aggro":3,"chase":true,"range":1,"spd":260}}]}],"lights":[{"x":5,"y":10,"r":6},{"x":5,"y":4,"r":5},{"x":12,"y":4,"r":5},{"x":8,"y":7,"r":5},{"x":4,"y":8,"r":5},{"x":13,"y":8,"r":5}],"encounter":{"region":3,"zone":"z05"},"counters":[],"noShift":false}